# Development Workflow

## Core Principles

1. **Plan first, code second** - Always start with SPEC.md or architecture discussion
2. **Context is everything** - Include relevant files, errors, and constraints
3. **Test after every change** - Verify functionality before moving on

## Code Standards

- Define data model before writing code
- Start with mock data instead of database
- Split code into multiple files
- Include error handling and input validation
- Test after every change

## Debugging

- Include complete error messages and stack traces
- Provide relevant code files and expected behavior
- Use browser console (Cmd+Option+J) to check for errors

## Quality Gates

- [ ] Code compiles without errors
- [ ] All tests pass
- [ ] Memory system updated with learnings
- [ ] Documentation updated
